WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.972
Replacing a policy in Arizona.

2
00:00:03.066 --> 00:00:05.898
Who does what, and the deadlines you need to know.

3
00:00:06.827 --> 00:00:11.249
A replacement happens when someone buys a new life insurance policy or annuity,

4
00:00:11.308 --> 00:00:16.834
and as part of that, an existing policy is lapsed, surrendered, converted,

5
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:20.108
borrowed against, reduced or otherwise changed.

6
00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:24.543
Replacement isn't illegal, but it's closely regulated,

7
00:00:24.602 --> 00:00:29.547
because the client can lose value: new surrender charges, a new contestable period,

8
00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.566
and higher premiums at an older age.

9
00:00:33.503 --> 00:00:35.685
Here's the producer's job in Arizona.

10
00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:41.006
First, the producer submits a statement, signed by the applicant and the producer,

11
00:00:41.026 --> 00:00:43.638
saying whether the applicant has existing coverage.

12
00:00:44.184 --> 00:00:46.679
Second, if a replacement is involved,

13
00:00:46.773 --> 00:00:50.886
the producer must present and read the replacement notice no later than when the

14
00:00:50.906 --> 00:00:55.271
application is taken, and both the applicant and the producer sign it.

15
00:00:55.817 --> 00:01:00.430
Third, the producer leaves the applicant a copy of the signed notice and any sales

16
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:04.072
materials used, and submits copies to the insurer.

17
00:01:05.012 --> 00:01:06.230
Now the insurers.

18
00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:11.791
The replacing insurer must notify the existing insurer within five business days,

19
00:01:11.815 --> 00:01:14.787
and keep its replacement records for at least five years.

20
00:01:15.078 --> 00:01:18.901
The existing insurer must let the owner know they can get information about the

21
00:01:18.921 --> 00:01:23.692
existing policy, and provide it within five business days of a request.

22
00:01:24.635 --> 00:01:29.317
And the consumer's safety net: a replacement policy comes with a thirty-day free

23
00:01:29.337 --> 00:01:31.368
look for a full refund,

24
00:01:31.462 --> 00:01:35.617
compared with at least ten days on a regular Arizona life policy.

25
00:01:36.071 --> 00:01:39.894
Finally, remember that using misrepresentation to persuade someone to replace a

26
00:01:39.914 --> 00:01:44.894
policy with another insurer is twisting, an unfair trade practice.
